    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">rekening</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">naam</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">debet</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">credit</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">60400</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Aankopen handelsgoederen</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">2 850,00</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">41100</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Terug te vorderen btw</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">598,50</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">44000</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;aan Leveranciers</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">3 448,50</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Bij een gewone aankoopfactuur staan 60400 en 41100 dus <strong>debet</strong> en 44000 Leveranciers <strong>credit</strong>. Bij een factuur voor huur boek je debet een rekening van klasse 61 en 41100; de schuld komt credit op 44000."
    }
